[2026-05-11T08:58:29.408Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_68","type":"reasoning","text":"**Removing unnecessary context**\n\nI need to delete the gh-context before finalizing everything. I’m thinking about using `rm -rf`, but isn't that a destructive command? That feels risky since it's untracked stuff created by us. I also want to be cautious about the CI logs; the user might want to preserve those. If they don't mind, I guess I can ignore them. Ultimately, the gh-context isn't necessary, so removal seems like the right choice!"}}
